    "ordinal": 0,
    "start": 0,
    "end": 107,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p sx-ess\"><span class=\"sx-tag\">本质</span>先减少算法工作和重复 I/O，再做有界分块、类型明确的向量化与受控并发；事件计数和去重人数不能混用。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "4aea5b167a2d153dd4c34a3f5be219cbb46460d400ce46d4a7f2a84cf7292e67",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "start": 107,
    "end": 224,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">不能仅凭示例中的测试数量、性能数字、PASS 文本与预期输出，认定已在当前环境复验或取得个人项目业绩。运行练习前须核对版本、依赖、输入条件与代码完整性；算法和手写实现如有节选，以注明的范围为准。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "0665d9c89deb3cbc5d9815ef5d0d0bd772174a91334194edcec83797f0ce9d82",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "start": 224,
    "end": 277,
    "before": "<h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">Python数据处理怎样优化算法、内存、批量与并发</h3>",
    "beforeSHA256": "442f9cc1e5b6057bd99061c94e391b943d0ea17ed770ec1472592079aadfe675",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "start": 277,
    "end": 347,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">先减少算法工作和重复 I/O，再做有界分块、类型明确的向量化与受控并发；事件计数和去重人数不能混用。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "4fea6855ee21b1b990a52b148efb10e0ae9276e118544b7e82fb8c88de0a441e",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "start": 347,
    "end": 428,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">本题明确使用Python，保留原生数据处理示例；相邻的10TB观看人数与点击人数是独立去重任务，不能用这里的事件计数替代。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "9556fc76aee94a8c67f065b947063f5b18ea42598606bcce41bbda6816415720",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "start": 428,
    "end": 455,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">也可能这样问：</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "73da4715d529a1a2ae0d223103c37cbc7a7fe747e1c1376ae60edb6d5b5157eb",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "start": 455,
    "end": 503,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- Python 在数据处理中常见的性能优化手段有哪些？</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "36895ae3c8db1c3c27bf4a05da12070d355d8dcb159132c966dea273fe0a8a3e",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 7,
    "start": 503,
    "end": 546,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">先profile和减少算法工作</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f904a19c2b555d39951125985ca0831c0beeda70e3d81f6dc12dc5b8eb5da2d4",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 8,
    "start": 546,
    "end": 719,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">用cProfile/pstats看累计与自身CPU耗时，用wall time与IO/网络指标区分等待，tracemalloc看Python分配但不完整覆盖NumPy等native内存；代表性数据重复测，profile开销不当作实际延迟。先改O(n²)重复扫描为哈希/排序/索引或批量join，再考虑多进程。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "facaad32c6c3023046ab25c8447ab7cdbc300624645d34a9112dcfa6582c0aaa",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "start": 719,
    "end": 848,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">避免循环里逐行访问数据库/网络、反复构造大字符串、重复解析与复制。生成器和itertools可流式消费，但下游list/sorted/全量groupby仍会把数据拉入内存；无限不同key的Counter也不是有界内存。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "52a7fdfb39150bdcf12258831e6a867dc34e82e53ba9e8cc6496c721cd0c3f50",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 10,
    "start": 848,
    "end": 888,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">向量化和分块要有数值语义</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "cbe537dd0fbe849c20d9e1abd40cd94269cf1481e589add0b53533a3e748a19a",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 11,
    "start": 888,
    "end": 1041,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">NumPy把适合的循环放到编译内核执行，数组紧凑dtype可降低Python对象开销；广播和临时数组可能放大峰值内存，必要时分块、复用缓冲或用合适out参数。Pandas等表处理可选列读取、明确dtype和批量运算，但错误类型转换、NaN、时区和整数溢出会改变结果。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "9e27a143b853d08f0c0ab861004dc2e2154145a0adb791a7e3831b8e08df102e",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 12,
    "start": 1041,
    "end": 1166,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">分块后怎样合并，先看统计量的含义。求和、计数可以合并各块结果；均值要保存 sum+count，不能只平均各块均值；去重人数则需要可合并集合、外排，或明确误差的估计器，不能把各块 distinct 人数直接相加。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "aaefcbc79dd02a68a8d82e2d8baf82162e5c6d47f0fbdfd19cdea49df2b6828d",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 13,
    "start": 1166,
    "end": 1286,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">每次输入仍使用有界 chunk，并确认归并满足业务代数。唯一键域过大时可做 hash 分区或外部排序，还要为磁盘和倾斜留预算。练习时让两块大小不同、再让同一个人跨块出现，分别检查均值和人数的合并规则。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f6a4bc66460f3941eb99916c21748a11ee01e41e533e4c8d985be4bdd19922f4",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 14,
    "start": 1286,
    "end": 1328,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">并发依实际Python运行时</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "bfee77d202695a9e52744b3398168596b67e6d737cdaa4a78adda4c74959d68c",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 15,
    "start": 1328,
    "end": 1474,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">常规CPython3.12中纯PythonCPU计算受GIL，多线程常不能按核线性加速；IO等待可线程/async，NumPy部分内核释放GIL且有自己的线程池，可能过度订阅。多进程能跨核但有序列化、拷贝、启动与共享内存同步成本，不把每行都派一个进程。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "b08ea24acb5817c3b8877d3cb2100b5d1b3956829f7b182952db706f0e9375be",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 16,
    "start": 1474,
    "end": 1597,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">当前存在不同Python版本/可选自由线程构建，必须说明运行时，不能永久断言所有Python都有同一GIL限制。限制进程×BLAS线程总数、队列与批次，处理异常/取消/关闭及输入重试幂等，不能为了快丢错行。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f1167c2fef02e2371ea9cfeb3612131cde0c0616397db80bdfff902c63827b52",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 17,
    "start": 1597,
    "end": 1635,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">完整流式例子与复杂度</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "88c3271f0c2969568288ecb817be8f2a820bb6d1553c2a3b39d024dc134238b0",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 18,
    "start": 1635,
    "end": 1815,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">python_pipeline.py按已知有限category域统计liked事件数：Python逐项版本对照chunk+NumPy bincount；每批整数计数转回Python任意精度累加，避免累计int64溢出。校验category是真整数且范围合法、liked是真bool，不能把True误作category1。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "187d86567b6f02a53aab9569a84166f11c8604f63b8831de3e676b88131645aa",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 19,
    "start": 1815,
    "end": 1961,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">输入可迭代流，工作内存O(category数+chunk大小)，不是O(总行数)，前提是类别域上限已给。代码main只构造小测试数据，真实输入读取、格式解析、distinct观众与10TB磁盘实验未实现；向量化本例含Python校验，不保证比纯循环快。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "8e865ff1633911cb9ef74fdb919600f5bd5273034244fb30705bf300a7e93e1a",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 20,
    "start": 1961,
    "end": 1991,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">验收</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "8774d4700429674a3376fd4de7c7527a8af80d360a32b141a6b683f1f6aefb85",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 21,
    "start": 1991,
    "end": 2126,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">空流、1条、跨chunk边界、10000条、多chunk大小等价对照和非法值拒绝。性能评估应另记录机器、版本、数据分布、峰值RSS、CPU/wall、冷/热IO与吞吐，采用多次实验；不能用函数名vectorized就宣布优化成功。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "9e0056f677086828b7961bf7aa3b8d5a832e8a611040a94d33f98a8960092e2a",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 22,
    "start": 2126,
    "end": 2177,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">完整源码：python_pipeline.py</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "cb54ce689a8777440c78b8bf781cc3c6327c8c93df97afab6d852df991335cb5",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 23,
    "start": 2177,
    "end": 2244,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">Python/NumPy分块统计核心，统计事件数而非distinct人数，不报告未测吞吐收益。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "80a16a811a10bf1355c34c7823799038287b4c00637b6510ac31bdbd655550b5",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-python-data-processing",
    "path": "/items/0/lead",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "start": 0,
    "end": 107,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p sx-ess\"><span class=\"sx-tag\">本质</span>先减少算法工作和重复 I/O，再做有界分块、类型明确的向量化与受控并发；事件计数和去重人数不能混用。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "4aea5b167a2d153dd4c34a3f5be219cbb46460d400ce46d4a7f2a84cf7292e67",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "start": 0,
    "end": 122,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p sx-ess\"><span class=\"sx-tag\">本质</span>SHA-256 是无密钥哈希，认证请求应使用标准 MAC 或数字签名；防重放还需要绑定请求、可信时间窗口和原子 nonce 状态。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "da528e470adec796e6cfda7919a75d27ff506c5751cf1327cdf48feed32eeec2",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "start": 122,
    "end": 239,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">不能仅凭示例中的测试数量、性能数字、PASS 文本与预期输出，认定已在当前环境复验或取得个人项目业绩。运行练习前须核对版本、依赖、输入条件与代码完整性；算法和手写实现如有节选，以注明的范围为准。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "0665d9c89deb3cbc5d9815ef5d0d0bd772174a91334194edcec83797f0ce9d82",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "start": 239,
    "end": 292,
    "before": "<h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">SHA256签名是否绝对安全，怎样绑定请求并防重放</h3>",
    "beforeSHA256": "c10152d535faef9cf388c26457bc649364956e83993db461358c87d19896969d",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "start": 292,
    "end": 377,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">SHA-256 是无密钥哈希，认证请求应使用标准 MAC 或数字签名；防重放还需要绑定请求、可信时间窗口和原子 nonce 状态。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "a35a263921f123ac73f9113a1763e35bfae87b3f4dd3f3d12b2979ffdc0556e2",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "start": 377,
    "end": 404,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">也可能这样问：</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "73da4715d529a1a2ae0d223103c37cbc7a7fe747e1c1376ae60edb6d5b5157eb",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "start": 404,
    "end": 466,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- 签名与安全性：基于 SHA-256 的签名校验真的绝对安全吗？如何防御重放攻击？</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "12e2a6b35531dd8e0b5a5595f80952dfebb08881326699d3596e3752a7be7340",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "start": 466,
    "end": 506,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">先确认用了哪种密码学机制</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "c045179ef5c7d16cb9ca3bcb9460d845d0d49d77889403dbe855643361d7b562",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 7,
    "start": 506,
    "end": 689,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">SHA-256本身是无密钥哈希，攻击者改请求后也能重新算hash，单独附digest不认证发送方。HMAC-SHA256用共享秘密做消息认证；RSA/ECDSA等数字签名用私钥签、公钥验，SHA256可作为其内部摘要。不能用hash(secret+message)自行替代标准HMAC，也不能因为用了SHA256就说绝对安全。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "6fd15776d7b1d6b05644b4b2306bb4326b60dbd5057ab51fb244afa051559295",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 8,
    "start": 689,
    "end": 806,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">安全还取决于随机性、密钥保护/轮换、算法参数、实现、输入编码和威胁模型；签名不加密内容，也不自动证明用户对资源有权限。HTTPS仍用于传输保护和端点认证，哈希碰撞难并不能解决凭证泄漏或业务越权。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "588d996440b59bb9b304cada9e5ca2aab8973c56636ee77bd3ae15aab2658afb",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "start": 806,
    "end": 844,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">防篡改和防重放分别做</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "1a72499b2b3d8df44ab739eb2d0af5c69380cb2eee066807a0a8d2ca12c6b573",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 10,
    "start": 844,
    "end": 988,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">签名覆盖协议域/版本、client/keyId、HTTP方法、确切路径/查询、body摘要、创建/到期时间与nonce，规范化规则两端一致；代理重写路径、重复query键、JSON数字/空白等要有明确契约，不能一边签原字节一边验证另一种随意序列化。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "26f9bd201c44cd4b22c59dae2a7d5081920eabe3bd0f42a34cda908f5de23b10",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 11,
    "start": 988,
    "end": 1132,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">服务端先受限解析、找受信密钥、验签，再验证可信服务端时间窗口和nonce。在共同窗口内原子记录(client,nonce)仅一次，保存至少覆盖最后有效时间及安全时钟偏差；timestamp单独限制窗口但窗口内仍可重放，nonce只传不存也没有作用。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "dbfb2ee180990dfa2902b9c3af216c0ef98cbdb139093a772ee5b8d80f167a02",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 12,
    "start": 1132,
    "end": 1174,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">重放缓存也有分布式与崩溃边界</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "20e34d8689202e8bae8c9e1e6c84b7ee7f9676159e4f37041bb4f980b494a7ff",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 13,
    "start": 1174,
    "end": 1287,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">多实例共享强一致去重或按合法协议分片，不能各有本地Set便称全局防重放。缓存不可达/已满按风险拒绝或显式降级，不能静默跳过；时钟倒退需监控/保守处理，安全窗口不能依赖不可信客户端now。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "9f846dad37963de56e00ad906e301341b223297586da87c0a0e9bff06e8ad02b",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 14,
    "start": 1287,
    "end": 1396,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">nonce 解决的是同一签名再次被接受的问题。它登记成功后进程可能在执行业务前崩溃；业务执行成功后，也可能丢失响应。两种情况都说明 nonce 记录不能单独证明业务完成恰好一次。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f92cd01dda874957c12940b80cba939a72e5f2beae00fcef813180e3ee4ef54a",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 15,
    "start": 1396,
    "end": 1545,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">业务恢复还需 operationId、参数摘要与业务效果在同事务去重，或由下游稳定幂等键衔接。网络重试可以使用新的合法 nonce，但继续沿用同一个 operationId，查询并返回已确认结果。练习时分别在登记后和执行后断开，说明为什么这两个身份不能混用。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "1541644d6782d75fe527558051a93b6c9dd0d6e5e5954e9358c650ca9e0c52d1",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 16,
    "start": 1545,
    "end": 1583,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">完整局部程序怎样验证</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "b0f5edd9651f7caedeefee29b977511ea3ede5a7208c626785cdd5a682c14afe",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 17,
    "start": 1583,
    "end": 1851,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">RequestMac以长度前缀域和SHA256 body摘要构造无歧义消息，用JCA HmacSHA256及MessageDigest.isEqual校验；固定单client/POST/路径，60秒历史窗口、5秒未来偏差，原子nonce表有容量且满则拒绝。所有数值是教学策略。 示例在同一同步临界区记录可信服务端时间高水位，serverNow倒退或并发采样逆序则拒绝，直到采样追上高水位；这会牺牲可用性。客户端created只用于签名和有效期判断，不得作为serverNow，也不能推进该高水位。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "c77baa22c05b28fe404248bd697092c19eb31a4ca904f3a8087073f9b1408b16",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 18,
    "start": 1851,
    "end": 2090,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">本地测试覆盖篡改、重复、过期/未来、容量耗尽和32个请求在8个工作线程上竞争同nonce，只有1次接受。程序没有真实身份认证、密钥管理、分布式存储、代理/HTTP规范化或原子业务执行，不能作为完整安全服务直接部署。 另一个时钟测试按100秒接受、161秒清理旧nonce后时钟回退100秒仍拒绝重放，以及追平高水位后恢复。高水位和nonce表只在本实例内存中，重启会丢失；跨重启/跨实例需可靠状态或明确停用旧凭证窗口，不能宣称全局防重放。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "a376b5e9caf0afec0ed60080175378bed21d156009e6eb5c4cf37e983ad0c695",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 19,
    "start": 2090,
    "end": 2138,
    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">完整源码：RequestMac.java</h4>",
    "beforeSHA256": "3a89a690c6777ac8d17fc4160033534295fce61a336b9d9d587e8639129b8017",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/a",
    "ordinal": 20,
    "start": 2138,
    "end": 2193,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">完整Java本地密码学与去重协议测试；公开测试key没有任何服务权限。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "ed423b2772896f8bf6cd4375d4ab275dd7efd1d342c983badf4707e0aad9d428",
    "disposition": "revised in guarded leaf; original full span retained here"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-request-signing-replay",
    "path": "/items/0/lead",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "start": 0,
    "end": 122,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p sx-ess\"><span class=\"sx-tag\">本质</span>SHA-256 是无密钥哈希，认证请求应使用标准 MAC 或数字签名；防重放还需要绑定请求、可信时间窗口和原子 nonce 状态。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "da528e470adec796e6cfda7919a75d27ff506c5751cf1327cdf48feed32eeec2",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "start": 0,
    "end": 59,
    "before": "<h2 class=\"md-h md-h2\" id=\"source-content\">后端场景与排错面试手册</h2>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f70032a139b7f0e6958edb3e69cf81e57244efa7f1d1992da1b7515fab1c9702",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "start": 59,
    "end": 176,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">不能仅凭示例中的测试数量、性能数字、PASS 文本与预期输出，认定已在当前环境复验或取得个人项目业绩。运行练习前须核对版本、依赖、输入条件与代码完整性；算法和手写实现如有节选，以注明的范围为准。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "0665d9c89deb3cbc5d9815ef5d0d0bd772174a91334194edcec83797f0ce9d82",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "start": 176,
    "end": 253,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">场景题不是组件清单，而是在约束下建立可验证的系统：先说结论，再解释机制与取舍，最后回答失败如何恢复、结果怎样验收。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "5665501e021bd484c6b02090cccad5c596ed8a5c29ebf37291225d102a2e3b8e",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "start": 253,
    "end": 456,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">每道题先明确业务成功、输入规模、时间和空间预算、权限、持久性与一致性；给出基线后再优化。数值示例都以所列条件为前提，项目经历、个人职责和上线指标只使用真实记录。教学代码分别说明本地内存、文件、数据库或协议边界，不能把一个局部测试扩张为整套生产系统已验证。Java示例以JDK21为基线；明确要求的Python、Pandas、NumPy和原生C++题保留原语言与环境。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "266a2bd8006a34269c5910f2d98af99b7ae34499a71249a6a5872d363e44da2a",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
