    "start": 1042,
    "end": 1078,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">18. 用确定性模型验证故障协议</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "b09edb8df695e8fda27c31841755ef3358efb6b681aa5f871df1a827e48275f8",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 22,
    "start": 1078,
    "end": 1111,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">19. 编码练习的契约测试</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "a60e22ad858e130348543b45d002d9b36c3cc3d5e705228383a0b22d0a0e48da",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 23,
    "start": 1111,
    "end": 1204,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">把本册当作跨知识点的案例入口。每次挑一个症状或业务约束，把它还原成请求、状态和资源的流动，再回到MySQL、Redis、MQ、并发或网络册查机制。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "3b767dd239e96f520f246d32a97a2e0da552c978e6378c582de7d72fb96020fa",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 24,
    "start": 1204,
    "end": 1245,
    "before": "<h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">第一轮：先建立三个案例骨架</h3>",
    "beforeSHA256": "8c864ae3eea369818d2cf3e6214e59e1536b98f5cfa34812c3e0ae52120bcc10",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 25,
    "start": 1245,
    "end": 1314,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- 2 · 线上排错与依赖隔离 → 3 · 性能归因与发布恢复 → 5 · 订单 库存与缓存一致性</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "7abcd3d35f533ed53b80f89b8fd140f4577298e15c1dd7837af26f681b7e870f",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 26,
    "start": 1314,
    "end": 1435,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">先练“接口慢了、依赖不可用、订单与库存并发变化”三类问题。每题先说明成功条件和影响范围，再列下一份需要的证据。遇到缓存一致性、连接池或线程池问题，先把相应基础短答接上，不在第一轮无边界展开所有系统设计。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "98394c9694ac1a0127b703cf3e911c20bfd06d734027802a5384d94790c8ec96",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 27,
    "start": 1435,
    "end": 1477,
    "before": "<h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">第二轮：用失败推动机制和选型</h3>",
    "beforeSHA256": "a1aed56cb2c3761969df0c7acf7e1fdeda59645686ff30ad8d48ef60c1c1ae63",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 28,
    "start": 1477,
    "end": 1548,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- 外部服务慢了怎样不拖垮自己 → 缓存与数据库一致性应该怎样回答 → 删除成功之后怎样阻止旧缓存复活</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "744e8450574686b316669e86a64c57de69aa9fa84e6f0684ca36a0b3d3bb1342",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 29,
    "start": 1548,
    "end": 1621,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- CI/CD上线前中后做什么，原子切换为何仍会丢请求或返回旧版本 → 13 · Agent运行与任务调度</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "bdbd47cf68010b6715f0e7676300a4878209a09f04d5f12fd392e78cd035c748",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 30,
    "start": 1621,
    "end": 1739,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">依赖变慢时，先解释最简单同步调用怎样占满线程或连接，再引出总超时、隔离和有界重试；缓存删除成功也要追问旧读回填。任务调度区分受理、领取、执行和持久完成，发布恢复则同时检查旧请求、旧版本和状态兼容。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f3835265ce6436c7842223eafff6387605dfd2273448ce8b762d5f32494b2452",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 31,
    "start": 1739,
    "end": 1782,
    "before": "<h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">第三轮：用观测和验收把案例闭合</h3>",
    "beforeSHA256": "aa675ac9019dc6d761917e21c77a2a8c190d73b79d75c9437f191984bd9d976d",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 32,
    "start": 1782,
    "end": 1916,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- 并行化意图识别是什么，如何实现并处理冲突和低置信度 → 模型API和工具失败怎样恢复，如何用可观测证据而非盲目重试保住Agent稳定性 → AI服务怎样测试耗时和定位Coding瓶颈，上线后业务、Token与调度优化如何证明</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "34d77d4211ece168f03b5100104963289e98c9f3ba6dd68f155513c238b7b442",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 33,
    "start": 1916,
    "end": 1958,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">- 14 · Agent 线上故障与工程验收</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "4171105a63fced90fcd8b43f6878e639f2235394fa19519e379f64ace6675423",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 34,
    "start": 1958,
    "end": 2087,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">AI案例从任务成功条件出发，先看意图冲突与低置信度，再检查模型、工具、排队和外部依赖各自的时间与失败类型。指标必须对应有效完成、延迟、错误和成本，不能以请求量或Token减少代替业务改善；用固定用例和故障测试检验优化。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "90bfb9d93e76c60d41651e5f53de848e6ac8787c78aac85e51266a0bd7482842",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 35,
    "start": 2087,
    "end": 2121,
    "before": "<h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">怎样算学会了</h3>",
    "beforeSHA256": "f43e3140c0fa97fb6efee394ab63cf844c42c85bdb311e132fbdb4b8237af3b6",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  },
  {
    "entryId": "own-practice-source-guide",
    "path": "/html",
    "ordinal": 36,
    "start": 2121,
    "end": 2227,
    "before": "<p class=\"md-p\">练习时先给一段总答，再用“现象→证据→判断→改动→反例→验证”展开。规模评估、海量数据、交易、信息流、安全与摄取等主题仍按目录继续，不需要给所有题套用同一场景或同一组参数。</p>",
    "beforeSHA256": "3490928137a7321b355eea32d7b48299c35404ed83c31fec1eb0186241b2c890",
    "disposition": "retained verbatim in staged field"
  }
]